   "A": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the alcoholic beverage control law, in relation to the\nauthorization to hold through a wholly owned subsidiary a branch office permit\nat the Finger Lakes Welcome Center; and authorizes the sale of cider",
    "basePrintNo": "S7904",
